    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 1A & 1B Olivemount Terrace, Dundrum, Dublin 14 to the market a unique opportunity to acquire two residential units being sold together in this highly sought-after and exceptionally convenient location in the heart of Dundrum. Olivemount Terrace enjoys an abundance of amenities on its doorstep including Dundrum Town Centre, a wide selection of local shops, cafés, bars and restaurants. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport with the LUAS Green Line within walking distance and numerous bus routes nearby, while the M50 and major road networks are easily accessible. A host of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, Marlay Park, Airfield Estate and a variety of sports and leisure facilities are all within easy reach, making this location second to none.\n\nNo. 1A comprises a two-bedroom ground floor apartment with bright and well-proportioned accommodation including a spacious lounge/living area, kitchen, two bedrooms and main family bathroom. The property benefits from a practical layout and also features an east-facing garden to the rear. While in need of modernisation and refurbishment throughout, No. 1A offers excellent potential to create a superb home in a prime Dublin 14 location.\n\nNo. 1B comprises a spacious three-bedroom top floor duplex presented in an “upside down” layout. The accommodation includes an entrance hallway, three well-proportioned bedrooms and main family bathroom on the lower level, while upstairs features a generous open plan living and kitchen area flooded with natural light. The living space also provides access to a private west-facing balcony, ideal for relaxing or entertaining while enjoying evening sunshine. No. 1B is also presented in need of refurbishment but offers enormous potential for the discerning purchaser.\n\nTogether, 1A & 1B Olivemount Terrace represent a rare and exciting opportunity to acquire a multi-unit property in one of Dublin 14's most desirable locations. Offering generous accommodation, private outdoor spaces and significant scope for refurbishment, this property is prime for an investor, or someone looking to acquire a larger family home in the Dundrum area to truly make their own. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n• 140 sqm combined floor area\n• BER C1 (both properties)\n• 5 Bedrooms/2 Bathrooms (combined)\n• Includes 2 bed ground floor apartment & 3 bed top floor duplex\n• In need of refurbishment throughout with excellent potential\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Sunny east facing rear garden (No. 1A)\n• Sunny west facing balcony (No. 1B)\n• Double glazed windows\n• Parking\n• Mature and highly sought after location\n• Within arm's reach of all of Dundrum's essential amenities\n• Dundrum Town Centre a stone's throw away\n• Plenty of bus routes on your doorstep\n• LUAS Green Line within walking distance\n• No onward chain\n• Prime for investors or those seeking to create a larger family home\n• Viewing highly advised!\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D14 A3T2"
      },
